      TERM DEPOSITS<br/>
      Macquarie Bank<br/>
      <br/>
      Account opening, from days to minutes.<br/>
      <br/>
      A cross-team effort replacing a slow, bureaucratic process with a lean digital journey.<br/>
      <br/>
      Change managed through evidence: A/B tests, feature flags, live old-vs-new comparisons and reconciliation reports.<br/>
